WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.973 --> 00:00:14.875
demon eyed the smiling boy suspiciously.

2
00:00:14.895 --> 00:00:17.296
"Aren't you scared of me?"

3
00:00:17.776 --> 00:00:18.437
asked the demon.

4
00:00:18.457 --> 00:00:20.738
"No," said the boy.

5
00:00:20.758 --> 00:00:22.119
"Should I be?"

6
00:00:22.139 --> 00:00:26.781
"Well, yes," said the demon.

7
00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:29.062
"I plan to eat you.

8
00:00:29.803 --> 00:00:31.744
Doesn't that sound terrible?"

9
00:00:33.216 --> 00:00:34.117
The boy shrugged.

10
00:00:34.517 --> 00:00:35.298
"Not really."

11
00:00:36.299 --> 00:00:39.221
The demon hesitated for a moment and then moved closer.

12
00:00:40.282 --> 00:00:42.444
Suddenly the boy changed into Wukong.

13
00:00:44.046 --> 00:00:46.688
The monkey pulled out his iron bar and swung.

14
00:00:47.869 --> 00:00:50.311
The demon jumped back, and Wukong missed.

15
00:00:50.331 --> 00:00:52.713
"Who are you?"

16
00:00:53.314 --> 00:00:54.294
demanded the demon.

17
00:00:54.314 --> 00:00:58.138
"I am Sun Wukong," said the monkey.

18
00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:00.380
"And you should be ashamed of yourself!

19
00:01:01.184 --> 00:01:03.185
What kind of monster eats children?"

20
00:01:03.205 --> 00:01:05.305
"Sun Wukong?"

21
00:01:05.705 --> 00:01:06.345
said the demon.

22
00:01:07.346 --> 00:01:08.926
thought you were trapped under a mountain.

23
00:01:09.926 --> 00:01:11.067
What are you doing here?"

24
00:01:12.707 --> 00:01:14.828
"My punishment is over," said the monkey.

25
00:01:14.848 --> 00:01:18.469
"I am traveling to the Western Paradise with the Tang Monk."

26
00:01:19.629 --> 00:01:20.869
demon's eyes lit up.

27
00:01:20.889 --> 00:01:22.170
"The Tang Monk!"

28
00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:34.052
lunged. The demon spun around and disappeared.

29
00:01:34.112 --> 00:01:37.495
The monkey returned to Chen's home and told everyone what had happened.

30
00:01:37.515 --> 00:01:42.739
"Because of you, I still have my son," said Chen.

31
00:01:42.759 --> 00:01:44.000
"Thank you."

32
00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.942
"You're welcome," said Wukong.

33
00:01:46.962 --> 00:01:51.165
"But I believe the demon now wants to capture the Tang Monk.

34
00:01:52.286 --> 00:01:54.748
So in the morning we must find a boat and leave."

35
00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:59.432
Meanwhile the demon was deep under the water.

36
00:02:00.596 --> 00:02:04.319
"I must capture the Tang Monk and eat him," he said to himself.

37
00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:08.022
won't be easy with that monkey around.

38
00:02:08.863 --> 00:02:10.184
I'll need some magic."

39
00:02:12.606 --> 00:02:14.488
that night a cold wind blew.

40
00:02:16.589 --> 00:02:18.451
A snowflake drifted to the ground.

41
00:02:20.272 --> 00:02:22.054
Then another one fell, and another.

42
00:02:25.196 --> 00:02:25.817
couldn't sleep.

43
00:02:25.837 --> 00:02:30.900
"It's freezing in here," he said to himself.

44
00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.561
looked at Wukong and Wujing.

45
00:02:33.701 --> 00:02:35.702
Both of them were sleeping soundly.

46
00:02:35.762 --> 00:02:39.624
"Those two look very comfortable," said the pig.

47
00:02:39.644 --> 00:02:42.565
"Their blankets must be warmer than mine."

48
00:02:44.826 --> 00:02:47.127
In the morning Wukong woke up, shivering.

49
00:02:47.147 --> 00:02:52.829
"Th-that was a t-terrible night's sleep," he said to himself.

50
00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:55.410
was so cold!"

51
00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:57.671
He looked down at his body.

52
00:02:58.872 --> 00:02:59.752
wonder I was cold!

53
00:03:00.564 --> 00:03:01.685
What happened to my blanket?"

54
00:03:02.606 --> 00:03:03.587
Wujing woke up.

55
00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:07.591
is it so cold in—ah-choo!—in here?

56
00:03:08.452 --> 00:03:09.573
Where did my blanket go?"

57
00:03:12.996 --> 00:03:13.897
looked at Bajie.

58
00:03:15.098 --> 00:03:18.140
The pig was tucked cozily under three blankets.

59
00:03:19.001 --> 00:03:20.242
Even his head was covered.

60
00:03:23.686 --> 00:03:24.406
gave him a kick.

61
00:03:24.426 --> 00:03:28.116
"Wake up, thief!"

62
00:03:28.216 --> 00:03:30.817
Bajie rolled over, giggling under the blankets.

63
00:03:31.657 --> 00:03:32.778
Wujing frowned.

64
00:03:32.798 --> 00:03:34.958
"You stole our—ah-choo!"

65
00:03:37.419 --> 00:03:38.259
scratched his head.

66
00:03:38.279 --> 00:03:40.860
"Why is it so cold anyway?

67
00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:41.700
It's spring."

68
00:03:44.741 --> 00:03:46.342
looked out the window and gasped.

69
00:03:46.362 --> 00:03:48.723
"It snowed last night!"

70
00:03:50.203 --> 00:03:53.144
They woke the Tang Monk and Chen, and everyone went outside.

71
00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:57.362
A thick blanket of snow covered the entire village.

72
00:03:57.382 --> 00:04:02.005
"It would be dangerous to cross the river in this weather," said Chen.

73
00:04:02.025 --> 00:04:04.766
"You should stay here until the snow melts."

74
00:04:06.607 --> 00:04:07.708
villager ran over.

75
00:04:07.728 --> 00:04:09.989
"The river is frozen solid!"

76
00:04:10.249 --> 00:04:10.710
he said.

77
00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:12.831
wonderful news!"

78
00:04:13.071 --> 00:04:14.292
The Tang Monk smiled.

79
00:04:14.352 --> 00:04:16.493
"Maybe we can walk across it."

80
00:04:19.054 --> 00:04:21.296
The travelers thanked Chen and said good-bye.

81
00:04:23.676 --> 00:04:26.357
Soon they were standing at the edge of the frozen river.

82
00:04:26.377 --> 00:04:30.118
"I wonder if it's safe to walk on," said Wujing.

83
00:04:30.138 --> 00:04:33.579
"I'll test it with my rake," said Bajie.

84
00:04:34.619 --> 00:04:37.640
The pig walked onto the ice and raised his rake.

85
00:04:41.261 --> 00:04:44.082
He brought the rake down hard, but the ice didn't crack.

86
00:04:44.102 --> 00:04:46.922
"It's solid," he said.

87
00:04:47.863 --> 00:04:50.604
The travelers stepped onto the ice and started walking.

88
00:04:53.288 --> 00:04:56.751
After a few hours, the riverbank was no longer in sight.

89
00:04:57.973 --> 00:05:01.015
Suddenly there was a rumbling sound, and the ice shook.

90
00:05:02.697 --> 00:05:03.498
"What caused that?"

91
00:05:03.798 --> 00:05:04.398
asked the monk.

92
00:05:04.418 --> 00:05:14.228
"I don't know," said Wukong, "But we should be—" Underneath them, the ice split wide open!
